WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.291
Welcome to AroNexa. Here's a quick look at the patient's side.

00:04.291 --> 00:13.211
Find a doctor or clinic by speciality, distance, language or fee, and book from real open times, for you or your family.

00:13.211 --> 00:20.467
The live queue shows your token, who's being seen now, and when to leave home. So you wait at home, not at the clinic.

00:20.467 --> 00:26.379
Appointments keeps every visit. If a doctor moves one, you'll see why, and you can rebook.

00:26.379 --> 00:31.693
My body puts your health records on a map of your body, coloured by what needs attention.

00:31.693 --> 00:39.269
Open any report to read your doctor's explanation, and watch a short explainer video, in English or Malayalam.

00:39.269 --> 00:44.179
Order medicines from your pharmacy, or compare prices to find the best quote.

00:44.179 --> 00:49.493
Book lab tests at home or at the lab, and follow each one through to its report.

00:49.493 --> 00:57.816
Bills keeps every payment and refund. And Records and sharing shows who can see your records, so you can stop sharing at any time.

00:57.816 --> 01:05.691
That's it. Manage your family's profiles, and use the Emergency button whenever you need help. Now, start exploring.
